# Earth Lens — environment variables
#
# This app requires NO environment variables to build or run.
# Landsat scene data is fetched from the Microsoft Planetary Computer STAC API,
# which needs no API key. The scene inventory is committed to the repo
# (data/scene-inventory.json) and bundled at build time.
#
# There are currently no required or optional NEXT_PUBLIC_ variables.
# If you later add a public, client-exposed config value, document it here, e.g.:
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-deployment.example.com
